<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cuenta vinculada — ZigZag</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: #f5f7fa;
            color: #1a1a2e;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }
        .card {
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
            max-width: 420px;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .icon {
            width: 72px;
            height: 72px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #e8f5e9;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
            font-size: 2rem;
        }
        h1 { font-size: 1.35rem; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
        .subtitle { color: #666; font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        .detail {
            background: #f5f7fa;
            border-radius: .5rem;
            padding: .75rem 1rem;
            font-size: .85rem;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        .detail strong { color: #1a1a2e; }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #009ee3;
            color: #fff;
            padding: .75rem 2rem;
            border-radius: .5rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: .95rem;
            transition: background .2s;
        }
        .btn:hover { background: #0082c3; }
        .hint { margin-top: 1rem; font-size: .8rem; color: #999; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">&#10003;</div>
        <h1>Cuenta de Mercado Pago vinculada</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Tu cuenta fue conectada correctamente. Ya podes recibir pagos de los padres a traves de ZigZag.</p>
        <div class="detail">
            ID de cuenta: <strong>{{ mp_account_id }}</strong>
        </div>
        <p class="hint">Ya podes cerrar esta ventana y volver a la app.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
